{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01115","headline":"相和歌辞 短歌行 · 聂夷中","name":"相和歌辞 短歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八月木荫薄，十叶三堕枝。\n人生过五十，亦已同此时。\n朝出东郭门，嘉树郁参差。\n暮出西郭门，原草已离披。\n南邻好台榭，北邻善歌吹。\n荣华忽消歇，四顾令人悲。\n生死与荣辱，四者乃常期。\n古人耻其名，没世无人知。\n无言鬓似霜，勿谓发如丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"聂夷中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}